   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Krea 2 · two-pass refine  (wifemaker moody-mode default)\n\nPIPELINE\n  UNET (Krea 2) -> LoRA 1 (character) -> LoRA 2 (style base, bypassed)\n  -> Pass 1: KSamplerAdvanced  er_sde / simple, 7 steps, CFG 1, 640x960, shift 0 (no ModelSampling node)\n  -> decode pass 1  (kept as the ColorMatch reference + preview)\n  -> LatentUpscaleBy bislerp x1.9\n  -> Pass 2: KSamplerAdvanced  euler / simple, 9 steps, start_at_step 4, CFG 1, negative zeroed (ConditioningZeroOut)\n  -> decode -> ColorMatch (hm-mkl-hm, strength 0.22) back to pass-1 tones\n  -> SaveImage   (final size 640x960 x 1.9 = 1216x1824; no extra upscaler)\n\nMODELS\n  UNET  : any Krea 2 checkpoint (Turbo / mixes) - set the file for this machine\n  CLIP  : qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors, type = krea2\n  VAE   : qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n  LoRA  : wm_<name>_krea2.safetensors; LoRA 2 is the gravure style base - un-bypass it once trained\n\nCUSTOM NODES\n  ColorMatch -> ComfyUI-KJNodes  (newer KJNodes: swap in ColorMatchV2; its image_target / image_ref inputs are in the opposite order)\n  Everything else is core ComfyUI.\n\nPROMPTING\n  Full sentences in caption order: framing -> camera height / distance -> pose (hands, legs) -> expression -> hair\n  -> outfit & fabric -> light direction & quality -> environment.  The negative does nothing at CFG 1 - describe what you want instead.\n"
   ],
